---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'July 25, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — Love Heat Relationship">
  <div class="legal-page mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-4 py-8">
    <h1 class="mb-2 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-text">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="legal-page__updated mb-6 text-xs text-accent-secondary">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="legal-page__body space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of loveheatrelationship.com (the "Site"), published by Love Heat Relationship ("LHR," "we," "us"). By using the Site, you agree to these Terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the Site.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">What the Site is</h2>
        <p>The Site publishes home-cooking recipes, travel-food articles, and kitchenware recommendations. It is a content site: we don't currently sell physical products directly. Some links on the Site are affiliate links to third-party retailers — see our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="text-accent underline">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Content is for information only</h2>
        <p>Recipes, cooking instructions, and other content on the Site are provided for informational and entertainment purposes only, "as is" and without warranty of any kind. Cooking times, temperatures, and ingredient substitutions may vary based on your equipment and ingredients — use your own judgment, food-safety practices, and common sense. If you have food allergies or dietary restrictions, check ingredient lists and product details yourself before cooking or purchasing; we can't guarantee a recipe or a linked product is safe for your specific needs.</p>
        <p>Nothing on the Site is professional, medical, or nutritional advice. Consult a qualified professional for guidance specific to your situation.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Affiliate &amp; third-party links</h2>
        <p>The Site links out to third-party retailers and vendors, some of which pay us a commission on qualifying purchases at no extra cost to you (see our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="text-accent underline">Affiliate Disclosure</a>). We don't control those third-party sites, their pricing, their availability, or their own terms and privacy policies, and we aren't responsible for your transactions with them.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>Unless otherwise noted, the text, photos, and other original content on the Site belong to LHR. You're welcome to view and share the Site for personal, non-commercial use, and to link back to it. Please don't republish, redistribute, or otherwise reproduce our content or photos without our prior written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">No warranties; limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>The Site is provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind, express or implied. To the fullest extent permitted by law, LHR is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Site, its content, or any third-party site you reach through it.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Changes to these Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Continuing to use the Site after an update means you accept the revised Terms. We'll update the "last updated" date above whenever we make a change.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Governing law</h2>
        <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Wisconsin, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these Terms? Email <a href="mailto:hello@loveheatrelationship.com" class="text-accent underline">hello@loveheatrelationship.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
